    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Sorry folks -- I didn&#39;t put two and two together. It turns out there was an error in the code that did not turn on the RMD button for User Occs. I just fixed it and pushed it to the master branch on Github. Please download the Github version of v1.0.5 and let me know if it works now. Instructions for downloading the package from Github are on the repository page: <a href=\"https://github.com/wallaceEcoMod/wallace\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/wallaceEcoMod/wallace&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792489617166000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1lang88P82jP5yFUzrEe8e\">https://github.com/wallaceEcoMod/wallace</a></div><div><br></div><div>Thanks so much for your patience, and for reporting this bug. I will be updating the CRAN version soon once I fix a few more other errors.<br></div><div><br></div><div>Jamie<br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
